//! Storage interpretation of the generated sparse Mandelbrot AIR.
//!
//! The scalar prover and this WebGPU placement share the same nominal row,
//! witness, and FCO-derived canonical codec. Physical lanes only choose rows
//! and storage addresses. They do not own a second column schema or witness
//! formula.

